Deep-Reach
==========

This project references the architecture and naming conventions of Agent-Reach
(https://github.com/Panniantong/Agent-Reach), which is licensed under MIT.

OpenCLI (https://github.com/jackwener/opencli) is used as an external browser
engine and is licensed under Apache-2.0.

No Agent-Reach source code is vendored by default. If code is copied later,
keep the original MIT notice in this file and in the copied files.
